      "updated": 1783100456245,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dropbox/Google Drive\n\nDropbox is a cloud-based file storage service that allows users to store and share files.\nIt provides a secure and reliable way to store and access files from anywhere, on any device.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Dropbox/Google Drive\n\nDropbox is a cloud-based file storage service that allows users to store and share files.\nIt provides a secure and reliable way to store and access files from anywhere, on any device.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "NJx908tghLy8XfoBB7dwC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -10736.4215138263,
      "y": 31571.018454536177,
      "width": 1190.5989990234375,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 311654674,
      "version": 928,
      "versionNonce": 1475095630,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783139004623,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- upload a file\n- download a file\n- share the file and view shared files\n- auto sync files across devices for manual sync button on UI\n\nOut of Scope\n- roll out own blob storage(separate SD problem altogether)\n- editing\n- viewing without downloading\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- availability >> consistency - as Its okay the updated file is not immediately reflected across globe\nas long as its available for someone to download!\n- low latency uploads and downloads(as low as possible)\n- support large files as 50gb\n    - resumable uploads\n- high data integrity (sync accuracy) - i.e. once data in sync it should reflect the same thing i.e. floders should be in sync\n- reliable and secure ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- upload a file\n- download a file\n- share the file and view shared files\n- auto sync files across devices for manual sync button on UI\n\nOut of Scope\n- roll out own blob storage(separate SD problem altogether)\n- editing\n- viewing without downloading\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n- availability >> consistency - as Its okay the updated file is not immediately reflected across globe\nas long as its available for someone to download!\n- low latency uploads and downloads(as low as possible)\n- support large files as 50gb\n    - resumable uploads\n- high data integrity (sync accuracy) - i.e. once data in sync it should reflect the same thing i.e. floders should be in sync\n- reliable and secure ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
