      "locked": false,
      "text": "File Security\n- Encryption in transit : use HTTPS, encrypt the data as its transferred b/w client and server.\n- Encryption at Rest : S3 provides features to enable encryption, it encrypts using a unique key and stores the key separately\n- Access Control : Only ShareList table entries should be able to access that file\n- Problem is with Download par url link anyone can download that file even though they are short lived, still security exposed for that duration\n    - Use IP binding\n    - or signed URLs could used only with authentication cookies that only exist on one device.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "File Security\n- Encryption in transit : use HTTPS, encrypt the data as its transferred b/w client and server.\n- Encryption at Rest : S3 provides features to enable encryption, it encrypts using a unique key and stores the key separately\n- Access Control : Only ShareList table entries should be able to access that file\n- Problem is with Download par url link anyone can download that file even though they are short lived, still security exposed for that duration\n    - Use IP binding\n    - or signed URLs could used only with authentication cookies that only exist on one device.",
